  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: ABDA-ABDI_en-US
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Localization::UnityEngine.Localization.Tables.StringTable
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en-US
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 39e33c5eeb7ca2c44a092038a07c8b59, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 6834900992
    m_Localized: 'When his father handed over the family sword, Abda knelt and swore
      to uphold the family''s truth until death.

      Abdi only smiled and said
      that honor was a burden for fools.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1265163849728
    m_Localized: 'During the Battle of the Black Gorge, one of the brothers fled
      the battlefield.

      Abdi accused Abda of cowardice, but Abda remained
      silent.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1722049384448
    m_Localized: During the feast, one of the cups was poisoned. Abdi assured that
      Abda had prepared the drink, swearing on his father's sword.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2313643380736
    m_Localized: 'The elders of the family gathered to judge the brothers'' dispute.

      Abda
      spoke briefly, but every word was consistent with his previous actions.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2677583138816
    m_Localized: That same night, one of the brothers left the castle. Abdi claimed
      that it was Abda who had escaped, taking the family signet ring.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
